[4915]="70028444\n1\tTalk to Dagoras at his camp\tDagoras is at his camp in Nan Curunír. You should speak with Dagoras to discover what clues he can offer to help find the strange figure's trail.\n2\tTalk to Dagoras at his camp\tDagoras is at his camp in Nan Curunír. You should speak with Dagoras about the mysterious executioner who attacked him.\n",
[4916]="7000EDE5\n1\tBring the frozen amulet to Nicca\tNicca lives somewhere along the southern edge of the great glacier, in the hills east of Barad Gaurhoth. Arre suggested you speak with Nicca and learn what you may of the amulets.\n",
[4917]="70050E21\n1\tLocate the scouting Orcs\tYou should find and defeat Orcs west of Thornholt.\n2\tDefeat scouting Orcs (quantity: see journal)\tYou should find and defeat Orcs west of Thornholt.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have found and defeated Orcs west of Thornholt.\n",
[4918]="7005A95A\n1\tCollect cured pork (total: 8)\030Collect hearty vegetables (total: 8)\tCured pork and hearty vegetables can be found at the feast hall in Vérnozal. You should collect cured pork and hearty vegetables.\n2\tCook shchi at the oven (quantity: see journal)\tAn oven can be found at the feast hall in Vérnozal. You should cook shchi for dwarf explorers at the oven.\n3\tDwarf explorers can be found in Vérnozal. You should give the shchi you cooked to the dwarf explorers.\t\n4\tTalk to Rúzat\tRúzat can be found at Steepset in Máttugard. You should talk to Rúzat.\n",
[4919]="70050A46\n1\tDeliver the dwarf-made sword sheaths to a collection box\030Collect dwarf-made sword sheaths (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire dwarf-made sword sheaths.\n",
